(a) Gaussian sandwich symbol
  [sqrt(F(p+a) F(p-a))]^2 / [F(p) exp(-a^2/mu^2)]^2 = 1 (both sides positive)
  3D version, ratio of squares: 1
  with a = hbar q/2: W_A(x,p) = F(p) * Int dq/(2pi) V~(q) e^{iqx} exp(-hbar^2 q^2/(4 mu^2))  [exact]

